{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026m2ydJYTW5Q1794842193.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>半山寶珊道有水管滲漏，水務署暫停附近一帶供水維修，預計明早6時恢復食水供應。</p><p></p><p>水務署安排了水箱，讓居民取用。涉事的是寶珊道一個電訊公司地盤內的食水管，水務署指懷疑水管因工程意外受損導致滲漏。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.WATER-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026wO9K81Q38F1794844027.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>水管供應食水範圍，包括克頓道5號、寶珊道6號及8號，涉及近200個單位，署方在晚上10時用水高峰後停水進行緊急維修，又指已與民政處及區議員等聯繫，為有需要市民提供支援。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T17:46:14.024253+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T15:07:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T11:46:46.913385+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T17:39:27.753306+00:00","content_hash":"0f4f2f74c4280ae2ed9cca5b67c889bf45e2f1b0ed803a3858c88c41943ab8d9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T17:46:14.024253+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}